  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Release Africa - PV and Battery storage. Feasibility and Infrastructure support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Release has developed a containerized movable solution to power rural areas and offers solar and battery power towards financial weak utilities, minigrids and NGOs. This project is support to feasibility studies and infrastructure investments, handed over from Release at no cost to the customer (utility).</narrative>
  </description>
